message: "If you use this code or these data, please cite them as below, with the NetRes sets of Vanhoucke and Coelho (2018) and the Solutions Update site of Ghent University."
type: software
title: "Closing open NetRes instances of the resource-constrained project scheduling problem with CP-SAT and a learned run order: code and data"
abstract: "The CP-SAT model and destructive lower-bound procedure, the NetRes runners for a laptop and for Kaggle notebooks, the frozen predictions and registry entries of the learned run orders, and the scripts and per-instance data extracts behind the paper of the same title."
